    <briefdescription>
<para>A single row in the command palette. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Index 0 = search box. Index &gt; 0 = action entry with name and shortcut labels. Inherits ComponentWithID so its <computeroutput><ref refid="classaction_1_1_row_1aa2b69c0e9c35ab7ab9fda0ec5862be87" kindref="member">selected</ref></computeroutput> <ref refid="classValue" kindref="compound" external="/Users/jreng/Documents/Poems/JUCE/docs/doxygen/doc/juce.tag">Value</ref> is wired into the <ref refid="classValueTree" kindref="compound" external="/Users/jreng/Documents/Poems/JUCE/docs/doxygen/doc/juce.tag">ValueTree</ref>. Self-managing: paints highlight and grabs focus based on its own <ref refid="classValue" kindref="compound" external="/Users/jreng/Documents/Poems/JUCE/docs/doxygen/doc/juce.tag">Value</ref>. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
